        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Training for Seasonal Employees may begin prior to the dates noted above. Such training shall not exceed sixteen (16) hours. The Employment date for such Seasonal Employees shall be the first day of assignment on the floor.",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                457,
